sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant Dashboard as odh-dashboard
    participant KServe as KServe Controller
    participant OMC as odh-model-controller
    participant DSGW as data-science-gateway
    participant KAP as kube-auth-proxy
    participant ModelPod as Model Serving Pod
    participant Client as External Client

    Note over User,Client: Workflow 1 — Model Deployment via Dashboard

    User->>DSGW: Navigate to dashboard (HTTPS/443)
    DSGW->>KAP: ext_authz validate session
    KAP-->>DSGW: Session valid + identity token
    DSGW->>Dashboard: Forward with x-forwarded-access-token
    Dashboard-->>User: Show model deployment UI

    User->>Dashboard: Select model, configure serving runtime
    Dashboard->>KServe: Create InferenceService CR<br/>(via kube-rbac-proxy, SubjectAccessReview)
    KServe->>KServe: Reconcile: select ClusterServingRuntime<br/>(vLLM, OVMS, MLServer), create Deployment + Service
    KServe->>OMC: Notify InferenceService ready
    OMC->>DSGW: Create HTTPRoute for model endpoint
    OMC->>ModelPod: Inject kube-rbac-proxy sidecar
    OMC->>OMC: Create ServiceMonitor for metrics

    Note over Client,ModelPod: Production Inference

    Client->>DSGW: POST /v1/models/my-model:predict<br/>(HTTPS/443, Bearer token)
    DSGW->>KAP: ext_authz validate token
    KAP-->>DSGW: Token valid
    DSGW->>ModelPod: Forward request (kube-rbac-proxy validates SAR)
    ModelPod-->>Client: Prediction response (JSON)

    Note over User,Client: Workflow 2 — Multi-Tenant Model Consumption (MaaS)

    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant MaaSCtrl as maas-controller
    participant MaaSGW as maas-default-gateway
    participant Authorino as Authorino
    participant MaaSAPI as Per-Tenant maas-api
    participant TenantUser as Tenant User

    Admin->>Admin: Create AITenant CR in ai-tenants namespace
    MaaSCtrl->>MaaSCtrl: Reconcile AITenant: bootstrap tenant namespace
    MaaSCtrl->>MaaSAPI: Deploy per-tenant maas-api
    MaaSCtrl->>MaaSGW: Create HTTPRoutes for tenant endpoints
    MaaSCtrl->>Authorino: Create Kuadrant AuthPolicy<br/>(dual-method: API key + bearer token)

    TenantUser->>MaaSAPI: Request API key
    MaaSAPI-->>TenantUser: API key (sk-oai-*)

    TenantUser->>MaaSGW: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>(HTTPS/443, API key)
    MaaSGW->>Authorino: Evaluate AuthPolicy
    Authorino->>MaaSAPI: Validate API key callback
    MaaSAPI-->>Authorino: Key valid + identity
    Authorino->>MaaSGW: Strip Authorization, inject<br/>X-MaaS-Username, X-MaaS-Group
    MaaSGW->>ModelPod: Route to KServe LLMInferenceService
    ModelPod-->>TenantUser: Chat completion response (streamed)

    Note over User,Client: Workflow 3 — Distributed Training Job

    participant Trainer as Trainer Controller
    participant Kueue as Kueue
    participant JobSet as JobSet Controller
    participant Workers as Training Workers
    participant MLflow as MLflow
    participant Registry as Model Registry

    User->>Trainer: Create TrainJob CR<br/>(model, dataset, training params)
    Trainer->>Trainer: Resolve ClusterTrainingRuntime
    Trainer->>JobSet: Create JobSet with worker pod templates
    JobSet->>Kueue: Workload admission request
    Kueue->>Kueue: Evaluate cluster resource availability<br/>(GPU quota, queue priority)
    Kueue-->>JobSet: Workload admitted
    JobSet->>Workers: Create distributed training pods<br/>(GPU nodes, NCCL/MPI)
    Workers->>Workers: Train model (distributed)
    Workers->>MLflow: Export training metrics
    Workers->>Workers: Save model artifacts to S3/PVC
    User->>Registry: Register model metadata (gRPC)
    Registry-->>User: Model version registered

    Note over User,Client: Workflow 4 — ML Pipeline Execution

    participant DSP as DS Pipelines Operator
    participant Argo as Argo Workflows
    participant Steps as Pipeline Step Pods

    User->>DSP: Submit pipeline via DSP SDK or Dashboard
    DSP->>DSP: Reconcile DSPA CR
    DSP->>Argo: Deploy pipeline API server + Argo controller
    Argo->>Steps: Execute pipeline DAG:<br/>create workflow pods per step
    Steps->>Steps: ML tasks (preprocess, train, evaluate)
    Steps->>Registry: Register model metadata (gRPC)
    Steps->>KServe: Create InferenceService CR (auto-deploy)
    KServe->>ModelPod: Deploy model serving pod
    Steps-->>User: Pipeline run complete,<br/>artifacts in S3, metadata in MLMD

    Note over User,Client: Workflow 5 — LLM-D Disaggregated Inference

    participant LlmdClient as User
    participant Envoy as Envoy Gateway
    participant EPP as EPP (Endpoint Picker)
    participant Prefill as vLLM Prefill Worker
    participant Decode as vLLM Decode Worker

    LlmdClient->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>(HTTPS/443)
    Envoy->>EPP: ext-proc: evaluate InferencePool endpoints
    EPP->>EPP: Score endpoints by:<br/>KV-cache utilization, queue depth,<br/>prefix cache affinity, LoRA affinity
    EPP-->>Envoy: Selected optimal endpoint
    Envoy->>Prefill: Route to prefill worker
    Prefill->>Prefill: Process prompt tokens
    Prefill->>Decode: Transfer KV-cache via NIXL<br/>(RDMA or TCP)
    Decode->>Decode: Generate output tokens
    Decode-->>Envoy: Stream tokens
    Envoy-->>LlmdClient: Streamed chat completion response
